# a kit's pads (its EDIT page's picture): a hit flashes its pad, and the flash fades by time (0.6 of 255 a millisecond:
# gone ~425 ms after a full hit), however often the UI draws, its colour blended by how much is left (padK: 16 full ..
# 0 dark). A soft hit fades out too, not a pad lit a few frames, then dark; a retrigger (hats at 16ths) brightens what
# is left: no dark frame between two hits
wait 300
expect trk 1
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
# a full hit: lit at once, then fading
drumhit 2 127
wait 20
expect pad2 >14
shot padflash_0.png
wait 100
expect pad2 >5
expect pad2 <15
shot padflash_1.png
wait 100
expect pad2 >0
expect pad2 <11
shot padflash_2.png
wait 300
expect pad2 0
# a soft hit (velocity 40: 80 of 255): partly lit, then dark
drumhit 3 40
wait 20
expect pad3 >0
expect pad3 <7
wait 150
expect pad3 0
# soft hits at 16ths (120 BPM: 125 ms apart): the pad never goes dark between them
drumhit 4 40
wait 110
expect pad4 >0
drumhit 4 40
wait 110
expect pad4 >0
drumhit 4 40
wait 110
expect pad4 >0
